v2, both bugs and the accessibility note fixed, tested live before sending (not just read back). SHA256 of the full assembled file: c19278a06035fca7923ad3141ccee75d49fecbae6bceee24bd187c55c941b45d (part 1/2 below, obrыv exactly at a newline, concatenate raw with part 2, no separators).

1. Drop zone after the first knot now exists (id tz2, "±" mark) — wired through the same setupDrop() as the first zone, so the drag path and the keyboard path both call the same commit(). Tested by dragging and by keyboard; both land the correction.
2. Fixed 3.5: commit() now validates Number(rawValue) before anything else, so a fractional or non-numeric entry is rejected and the field is left showing what you typed. Retested with "3.5" — correctly refused, field untouched, no knot tied.
3. Dropped role="img" from the outer svg (role="group" now) and focus moves to the first active bead after a correction, instead of to <body>. This is the one I'm not closing myself: no screen reader tested, only that Tab/focus() lands where I said it would.

